### Ordre de demarrage : discovery-service -> config-service -> account-service -> transaction-service -> gateway-service

### Eureka : tableau de bord http://localhost:8761 (tous les services doivent etre UP)
GET http://localhost:8761/eureka/apps
Accept: application/json

### Config Server : configuration fournie a transaction-service (contient bank.transaction.max-amount=1000)
GET http://localhost:9999/transaction-service/default

### Config Server : configuration commune
GET http://localhost:9999/application/default

### Valeur du plafond vue par transaction-service
GET http://localhost:8082/actuator/env/bank.transaction.max-amount

### Gateway - route statique vers account-service
GET http://localhost:8888/api/accounts

### Gateway - route statique vers transaction-service
POST http://localhost:8888/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "accountId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111", "amount": 100, "currency": "MAD",
  "type": "DEBIT", "merchantCategory": "RESTAURANT", "country": "MA" }

### Gateway - plafond depasse (1000) -> 400
POST http://localhost:8888/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "accountId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111", "amount": 1500, "currency": "MAD" }

### Gateway - route dynamique (discovery locator)
GET http://localhost:8888/account-service/api/accounts

### Gateway - routes chargees
GET http://localhost:8888/actuator/gateway/routes

### Rafraichir la config apres modification de config-repo/transaction-service.properties
POST http://localhost:8082/actuator/refresh
